王限鄒陽對梁孝王的上書。","surfaces":["子胥"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p017","quote":"昔卞和獻寶，楚王刖之；李斯竭忠，胡亥極刑。是以箕子詳狂，接輿辟世，恐遭此患也。願大王孰察卞和、李斯之意，而後楚王、胡亥之聽，無使臣為箕子、接輿所笑。臣聞比干剖心，子胥鴟夷，臣始不信，乃今知之。願大王孰察，少加憐焉。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:p017","text":"昔卞和獻寶，楚王刖之；李斯竭忠，胡亥極刑。是以箕子詳狂，接輿辟世，恐遭此患也。願大王孰察卞和、李斯之意，而後楚王、胡亥之聽，無使臣為箕子、接輿所笑。臣聞比干剖心，子胥鴟夷，臣始不信，乃今知之。願大王孰察，少加憐焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"卞和","kind":"person","person_id":"9j0_saz_b8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"y9v_xi8_8n3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"9lp_b6m_laq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"胡亥","kind":"person","person_id":"n39_fsx_avv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"箕子","kind":"person","person_id":"xxu_9lb_1z0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"接輿","kind":"person","person_id":"8f4_qc5_g5e","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"4qt_ofp_ysv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"卞和","kind":"person","person_id":"9j0_saz_b8g","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"李斯","kind":"person","person_id":"9lp_b6m_laq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"y9v_xi8_8n3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-083-luzou:m017-0057","s